$DATUM 1-(4,5-Bis(benzyloxy)picolinoyl)-2-methyl-1,2,4-triazinan-3-one (11).
4,5-Bis(benzyloxy)picolinic acid (5.8 g, 17 mmol),
2-methyl-1,2,4-triazinan-3-one (2.0 g, 17 mmol), EDC (5.0 g, 26 mmol),
and HOBT (1.3 g, 8.7 mmol) were suspended in DMF (55 mL) and stirred at
room temperature under nitrogen overnight. The reaction was diluted with
water and stirred for 1 h. The solid formed was filtered and dried. The
solid was then resuspended in Et2O and filtered. The desired product (6.7
g, 89%). 1H NMR (300 MHz, DMSO-d 6): δ (ppm) 8.27 (s, 1 H) 7.18-7.73 (m,
11 H) 6.95 (br s, 1 H) 5.14-5.44 (m, 4 H) 3.94 (br s, 2 H 2.75-3.25 (m, 5
H). ESI-MS: m/z 433.6 [M + H]+.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Discovery of Efficacious Pseudomonas aeruginosa-Targeted
Siderophore-Conjugated Monocarbams by Application of a Semi-mechanistic
Pharmacokinetic/Pharmacodynamic Model
