$DATUM 2-Cyclopentyl-2-hydroxy-N-(2-hydroxy-ethyl)-2-phenyl-acetamide (62):
After activation of 1 (4g, 0.018mol) with CDI (4.08g, 0.025mol) in DMF
(20ml), ethanolamine (2.4g, 0.039mol) was added and the mixture was
stirred at 40°C over night. The mixture was quenched with water and
extracted with TBME. The extract was washed with 10% aq. sodium
bicarbonate and brine and evaporated to obtain crude 62 which was
recrystallized from toluene. Yield 4.1g, 0.0156mol, 86%. 1H-NMR (600 MHz,
DMSO-d6): δ = 1,23 (m, 2H), 1.3-1.6 (m, 6H), 2.95 (quintet, 1H), 3.05 and
3.15 (each m, each 1H, CH2-N), 3.36 (m, 2H, CH2-O), 4.68 (t, 1H, OH),
5.56 (s, 1H, OH), 7.20 (t, 1H), 7.29 (t, 2H), 7.57 (d, 2H), 7.74 (t, 1H,
NH); FTIR-microscope in transmission: 3351 (N-H, O-H), 2952, 2868, 1659
(N-C=O), 1544 (amide II), 1494, 1469, 1446, 1425, 1339, 1280, 1243, 1168,
1076 (C-OH), 692; HR-MS, calc. for M+H = C15H22O3N 264.15942, found
264.15938 (-0.14ppm), calc. for M+Na = C14H21O3NNa 286.14137, found
286.14125 (-0.25ppm). 13C NMR (600MHz, CD3OD): 25.35, 25.49, 25.57,
26.05, 40.9, 45.9, 60.0, 79.4, 125.3, 126.5, 127.3, 142.8, 175.6.
