$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Compound (E)-74. A solution of (E)-72 (229 mg, 0.69 mmol) and 73 (242 mg,
1.04 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (10 mL) was treated with EDCI (199 mg, 1.04 mmol)
and DMAP (127 mg, 1.04 mmol). The reaction mixture was stirred at room
temperature overnight. The reaction was quenched with the addition of
saturated aqueous NH4Cl and extracted with CH2Cl2 (3×). The combined
organic phases were dried over MgSO4, filtered, and the solvent was
removed under reduced pressure. Flash chromatography (SiO2, 30%
EtOAc-hexanes) afforded (E)-74. Viscous, pale yellow oil, yield 320 mg,
85%. 1H NMR (600 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.42 (d, J = 8.6 Hz, 1H), 7.32 (m, 2H),
7.27 (m, 1H), 7.23 (d, J = 7.4 Hz, 2H), 6.76 (m, 2H), 6.72 (s, 1H), 5.81
(s, 1H), 4.57 (s, 2H), 4.04 (t, J = 6.9 Hz, 2H), 3.99 (s, 3H), 3.88 (s,
3H), 3.66 (s, 3H), 3.19 (t, J = 7.3 Hz, 2H), 3.08 (t, J = 7.2 Hz, 2H),
2.44 (t, J = 6.8 Hz, 2H), 1.92 (q, J = 7.3 Hz, 2H), 0.96 (t, J = 7.4 Hz,
3H); 13C NMR (150 MHz, CDCl3) δ 172.3, 162.4, 156.4, 154.4, 153.2, 142.1,
137.7, 137.6, 128.5, 127.8, 127.4, 125.7, 122.0, 119.6, 116.2, 113.2,
108.7, 93.0, 73.5, 55.8, 53.6, 45.1, 37.2, 32.7, 26.3, 24.9, 20.8, 13.1;
IR (film) νmax 2957, 1746, 1702, 1623, 1559, 1439, 1408, 1331, 1250,
1226, 1200, 1149, 1066, 1032, 944, 810 cm-1; HRMS ESI-TOF m/z 547.2551
(C30H34N4O6 + H+ requires 547.2551).
