$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: This intermediate was dissolved in DCM (1 mL),
and TFA (0.3 mL) was added. The resulting mixture was agitated for 2 h
and then concentrated. The isolate was purified by preparative HPLC using
an acetonitrile/water/formic acid gradient providing the title compound
(37 mg, 91% yield).
N-(4-Aminomethyl-phenyl)-3-[3-(4-cyano-phenyl)-ureidomethyl]-benzamide
(45). Prepared according to the procedure used for the synthesis of 42:
85%yield. 1H NMR (400MHz, DMSO) δ 10.38 (s, 1H), 9.86 (s,1H), 7.89 (s,
1H), 7.84 (d, J = 7.2Hz, 1H), 7.79 (d, J = 8.5Hz, 2H), 7.79-7.61 (m, 5H),
7.55-7.47 (m, 2H), 7.41 (d, J = 8.5Hz, 2H), 4.40 (d, J = 5.8Hz, 2H), 3.94
(s,2H). ESMS: m/z 400 (M + H).
